     notification_channels/dashboard_layout/automations/quiet_hours) — verbatim
     titles + descriptions, lucide→SF Symbol mapping.
   • 2-row read-only deny-list (tariffs, sound_prefs) with reason + alt path.
   • Per-section danger ConfirmDialog ("Reset {{name}}?" / "{{description}} This
     action is permanent.") → useResetSection (POST /settings/reset {section}).
   • Danger zone with requireTypedConfirmation="RESET" → useResetAllSettings
     (POST /settings/reset {}); confirm disabled until the field reads RESET.
   • toast.success(title, "{{count}} item(s) reset across {{sections}} section(s)").
   • SudoCanceledError → silent no-op (no toast), dialog closes.
   • cache invalidation on success (qc.invalidateQueries()).
  P4 states contract (every state renders, none hidden):
   loading→skeleton · ready · empty(no resettable sections→friendly empty, danger
